# Enemy Aegis: the SHIELD CARRIER of the middle nights (from night 4, the Hive's nights; MatchCoop's sprinkle). A
# brute-sized body, not tough itself (150 health), with a wide bubble of darkness (about 10 m) and a very large shield battery: the bubble squishes the
# players' fields back and covers the demons around it, a hit takes the battery first, and it bites structures hard.
# An empty battery collapses the bubble for good. Slow. Dark indigo.
Prefab gameEnemyAegis
	CullMode RootOnly
	Component Scene
		Prefab CubeGuy        # the model - see enemyGrunt.pre
			Position 0 1.355 0
			Scale 0.55
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.98
		Density 260
		Friction 0
		LockRotation true
		ContactEvents true
	Component Force
		Team 1
		Output 1.9
		Reach 22
		Centered true
	Component Network
	Component GameUnit
		ShortName AEGIS
		Color 0.3 0.12 0.55
		HealthMax 150
		EnergyMax 700
		ShieldOutput 1.9
		MoveSpeed 2.4
		AttackRange 1.9
		AttackInterval 1.5
		AttackDamage 24
		PlayerDamage 30
		StructureDamage 80
		EmitterDrain 10
		AlwaysDisplayHealth true
